canvas 460 280
label "Graph: an item becomes a node with an IRI (highlighted), exported as JSON-LD, Turtle and N-Quads; the asc: ontology, aligned to SKOS, PROV-O and DCTerms in OWL 2 RL, types it; there are no blank nodes and no reasoner at build"
caption "The highlighted node is the item's web address; the three files on the right are one graph in three syntaxes."
box item 16 40 120 50 "item|/concepts/<slug>/"
box node 176 40 120 50 "graph node|(IRI)" acc
box v1 336 20 108 34 "JSON-LD"
box v2 336 62 108 34 "Turtle"
box v3 336 104 108 34 "N-Quads"
box onto 176 130 124 60 "ontology asc:|SKOS · PROV-O|DCTerms · OWL 2 RL"
box no 16 130 120 60 "no blank nodes|no reasoner|at build"
arrow item node
arrow node v1
arrow node v2
arrow node v3
arrow onto node
note "one graph, three syntaxes; what you read is what was emitted"
